    "discovery_graph": {
      "purpose": "Scalable RSA data discovery: portal fan-out to 500 representative full project-packages across 16 ODD cells; drawings preserved page-by-page (multimodal first-class). Owner decisions 2026-08-25: polite 1 rps/2-concurrent per host, Bing+CSE behind one provider seam, low-conf classify auto-reserves, licensed sources case-by-case, targets weighted by gap+risk.",
